Koffr contains no third-party source code. The projects listed below were
studied as prior art, and some of their architectural approaches informed the
design of Koffr. Their behaviour and their published documentation were the
reference; their source code was not copied.

  - wal-g          https://github.com/wal-g/wal-g          (Apache-2.0)
  - Databasus      https://github.com/databasus/databasus  (Apache-2.0)
  - plakar         https://github.com/PlakarKorp/plakar    (ISC)

Koffr orchestrates the native backup tools shipped with PostgreSQL and MariaDB
(pg_basebackup, pg_receivewal, pg_dump, mariabackup, mariadb-dump,
mariadb-binlog). It does not vendor, modify or redistribute them.
